Package: rebot-teleop
Version: 1.2.2
Architecture: riscv64
Maintainer: Seeed Studio <support@seeed.cc>
Installed-Size: 3450
Depends: 
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Seeed-Solution/rebot-armd
Description: reBot B601-DM arm control daemon (armd), camera vision and web cockpit for reCamera
 Runs armd on the reCamera SG2002 with the arm on the B4 board CAN bus
 (Damiao motors), starts a Wi-Fi access point, and serves a browser
 cockpit for teleoperation, hand-eye calibration and tap-to-grasp.
 Includes rebot-vision, the camera process: H.264 video over WebSocket,
 YOLO object detection and ArUco markers (modes off / yolo / aruco / both),
 so no other camera app is needed. YOLO models are not included; the model
 already on the device is used. Records joint state and commands to
 Parquet files.
